Package: kulan-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: libreoffice-writer, libreoffice-calc, libreoffice-impress, libreoffice-gnome, vlc, gimp
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ office and media apps
 LibreOffice (documents, spreadsheets and slides), VLC and GIMP: the office
 and media apps built into @NAME@ 2.0. Systems installed from an earlier
 version can add them from the Update Center.
